{"n":4,"title":"You're not from here, are you?","blurb":"Говорить, откуда вы","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"You're not from here, are you?","sub":"","html":"<p>Откуда ты — и разговор у стойки регистрации.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Говорить, откуда вы</li><li>Называть свою национальность</li><li>Говорить, что неверно: isn't, aren't</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите страны, которые вы знаете по-английски.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"Turkey"},{"label":"Spain"},{"label":"Japan"},{"label":"Brazil"},{"label":"China"},{"label":"the UK"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"the USA","ru":"США","kk":"АҚШ","def":"I'm from the USA.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/95b67708c269.mp3"},{"en":"Brazil","ru":"Бразилия","kk":"Бразилия","def":"Josué is from Brazil.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/ceb73885cffc.mp3"},{"en":"the UK","ru":"Великобритания","kk":"Ұлыбритания","def":"Aberdeen is in the UK.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/0d6b4d2cf26e.mp3"},{"en":"Spain","ru":"Испания","kk":"Испания","def":"Madrid is in Spain.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/7c546585c731.mp3"},{"en":"Russia","ru":"Россия","kk":"Ресей","def":"Alisa is from Russia.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/b3fe0e948edd.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите страну, которую вы слышите.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/50986bdacf18.mp3","options":["Turkey","Japan","China"],"answer":"Turkey","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите страну, которую вы слышите.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/d0b435d630ec.mp3","options":["Japan","China","Spain"],"answer":"China","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите страну, которую вы слышите.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/76df6cf44b6e.mp3","options":["Brazil","Russia","Japan"],"answer":"Japan","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"Turkey","ru":"Турция","kk":"Түркия","def":"Havva is from Turkey.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/50986bdacf18.mp3"},{"en":"China","ru":"Китай","kk":"Қытай","def":"Beijing is in China.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/d0b435d630ec.mp3"},{"en":"Japan","ru":"Япония","kk":"Жапония","def":"Tokyo is in Japan.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/76df6cf44b6e.mp3"},{"en":"Australia","ru":"Австралия","kk":"Австралия","def":"Perth is in Australia.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/4ba78f9a65be.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"from","ru":"из","kk":"қайдан","def":"I'm from Turkey.","img":"/course/a0/img/l4-from.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/0b1e95cfd977.mp3"},{"en":"country","ru":"страна","kk":"ел","def":"Japan is a country.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"nationality","ru":"национальность","kk":"ұлт","def":"My nationality is Turkish.","img":"/course/a0/img/l4-nationality.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/5f2321ee78ec.mp3"},{"en":"email","ru":"электронная почта","kk":"электрондық пошта","def":"My email is leila@mail.com.","img":"/course/a0/img/l4-email.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a88b7dcd1a9e.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"note","title":"Страна → национальность","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Страна</th><th>Национальность</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Turkey</td><td>Turkish</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Spain</td><td>Spanish</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Brazil</td><td>Brazilian</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Japan</td><td>Japanese</td></tr></table><p>Страна и национальность — разные слова.</p><p>Оба всегда с заглавной буквы: <b>T</b>urkey, <b>T</b>urkish.</p><p>Без <b>the</b>: I'm from Turkey. (Но: the UK, the USA.)</p>"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cols","title":"Страна или национальность?","sub":"","columns":["Страна","Национальность"],"items":[{"text":"Turkish","col":1},{"text":"Spanish","col":1},{"text":"the USA","col":0},{"text":"Russia","col":0},{"text":"Japan","col":0},{"text":"Brazilian","col":1}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Одно — «да», другое — «нет».","items":[{"text":"I'm from Turkey.","src":null},{"text":"I'm not from Spain.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"to be — все лица","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Утверждение</th><th>Отрицание</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>I'm from Russia.</td><td>I'm not from Russia.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>You're from Spain.</td><td>You aren't from Spain.</td></tr><tr><td>He</td><td>He's from Brazil.</td><td>He isn't from Brazil.</td></tr><tr><td>She</td><td>She's from Japan.</td><td>She isn't from Japan.</td></tr><tr><td>We</td><td>We're from Perth.</td><td>We aren't from Perth.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>They're from China.</td><td>They aren't from China.</td></tr></table><p><b>am</b> с I · <b>is</b> с he, she, it · <b>are</b> с you, we, they.</p><p>Для «нет» добавьте <b>not</b>: is not = <b>isn't</b>, are not = <b>aren't</b>.</p><p>С I всегда <b>I'm not</b> — «I amn't» не бывает.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">I'm и you're были в уроке 2.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Where are you from?","I'm from Turkey.","She's from Japan.","We aren't from Sydney.","They're from Brazil.","My nationality is Turkish."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ from Japan.","options":["are","am","is"],"answer":"is","why":"is — с he, she, it.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"They ___ from China.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":"are","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ from Russia.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":"am","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He","after":"from Spain. He's from Brazil.","answers":["isn't"],"bank":["isn't","am not","aren't"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"We","after":"from Sydney. We're from Perth.","answers":["aren't"],"bank":["isn't","aren't","am not"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"from the UK. I'm from the USA.","answers":["am not"],"bank":["am not","isn't","aren't"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["from?","Where","you","are"],"answer":"Where are you from?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["are","They","not","China.","from"],"answer":"They are not from China.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","nationality","My","Turkish."],"answer":"My nationality is Turkish.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","am","from","the","Turkey."],"bad":3,"answer":"I am from Turkey.","why":"Перед большинством стран the не ставится."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","are","from","Japan."],"bad":1,"answer":"She is from Japan.","why":"С she — is."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["We","not","are","from","Perth."],"bad":1,"answer":"We are not from Perth.","why":"not ставится после are."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Where are you from?","options":["I'm twenty.","I'm from Turkey.","Nice to meet you."],"answer":"I'm from Turkey.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Are you Spanish?","options":["No, I'm not. I'm Brazilian.","No, I don't.","Yes, I do."],"answer":"No, I'm not. I'm Brazilian.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Where in Australia?","options":["I'm Australia.","We're from Perth.","It's a country."],"answer":"We're from Perth.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Откуда Алиса?","src":"/course/a0/audio/48cbbe58445e.mp3","options":["Spain","Russia","Turkey"],"answer":"Russia","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","before":"I'm from","after":".","answers":["Aberdeen"],"bank":["Aberdeen","Australia","Moscow"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/b709049ec828.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Откуда в Австралии они?","src":"/course/a0/audio/c9dfef7d5f48.mp3","options":["Sydney","Perth","Melbourne"],"answer":"Perth","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Они из Сиднея?","src":"/course/a0/audio/f6ac51f4364f.mp3","options":["Yes, they are.","No, they aren't.","Yes, we are."],"answer":"No, they aren't.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Лейлу.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Leila</p><p>Hello! I'm Leila.</p><p>I'm from Turkey. I'm Turkish.</p><p>My email is leila@mail.com.</p><p>My friends are from Brazil. They aren't Turkish.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Leila is from Turkey.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Leila</p><p>Hello! I'm Leila.</p><p>I'm from Turkey. I'm Turkish.</p><p>My email is leila@mail.com.</p><p>My friends are from Brazil. They aren't Turkish.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Her friends are Turkish.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Leila</p><p>Hello! I'm Leila.</p><p>I'm from Turkey. I'm Turkish.</p><p>My email is leila@mail.com.</p><p>My friends are from Brazil. They aren't Turkish.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Her friends","after":"from Brazil.","answers":["are"],"bank":["am","is","are"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Leila</p><p>Hello! I'm Leila.</p><p>I'm from Turkey. I'm Turkish.</p><p>My email is leila@mail.com.</p><p>My friends are from Brazil. They aren't Turkish.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какая национальность у Лейлы?","options":["Brazilian","Turkish","Spanish"],"answer":"Turkish","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Leila</p><p>Hello! I'm Leila.</p><p>I'm from Turkey. I'm Turkish.</p><p>My email is leila@mail.com.</p><p>My friends are from Brazil. They aren't Turkish.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о себе.","sub":"Ваша страна, город и одно неверное утверждение.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I'm from ___ .</li><li>I'm not from ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm from</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm not from</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Kazakhstan</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Turkey</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Spain</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Japan</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">the UK</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">my nationality is</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>В предложении 1 есть <b>from</b> + страна.</li><li>В предложении 2 есть <b>not</b>.</li><li>Страны — с заглавной буквы.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["Where are you from?","I'm from Kazakhstan.","I'm not from Russia.","My nationality is Kazakh."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 4 пройден","sub":"Урок 4 из 24 · Юнит 1 пройден","items":["Я могу сказать, откуда я.","Я могу назвать свою национальность.","Я могу использовать isn't и aren't."]}]}
